  "description": "Jeong I-Seo seemed to have it all. As the successful CEO of his own fashion brand and the sole male heir to an affluent family, his life was absolute perfection...until an unexpected, late-onset secondary gender presentation as an Omega turned everything upside down. \n\nDesperate to endure the torturous heat threatening to destroy his composure, I-Seo swallowed his pride and turns to a discreet rental service app to hire an Alpha, only to entangle himself with Yoon Gang-Hyuk, a man whose breathtaking beauty is matched only by his ruthless, manipulative nature. What I-Seo expects to be a quick, transactional fix rapidly spirals into a dangerous power dynamic. Little does he realize that by opening his door to Gang-Hyuk, he has willingly invited a gorgeous piece of trash inside, one destined to unravel every last piece of his meticulously ordered life.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
